OL,3,GNEWSACoventry City set to buy council
OL,4,Aland in #1.6m deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoventry City Football Club is set to
OL,7,Fcomplete the #1.6m purchase of land
OL,8,Fnext to its Coventry Building Society
OL,9,FArena home.
OL,11,FThe purchase of the council-owned Car
OL,12,FPark C land, on the opposite side of
OL,13,Fthe A444 from the stadium, is set to be
OL,14,Fsigned off by Coventry City Council at
OL,15,Fa cabinet meeting on 13 October.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
