OL,3,GNEWSACoventry City set to buy council
OL,4,Aland in #1.6m deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deal has been described as a
OL,7,F"win-win" by the council, who have
OL,8,Ftaken steps to develop a mutually
OL,9,Fbeneficial relationship with football
OL,10,Fclub and stadium owner, Doug King,
OL,11,Fafter years of conflict with the club's
OL,12,Fprevious owners.
OL,14,FCouncillor Lynnette Kelly, Deputy
OL,15,FLeader of the council, said: "Control
OL,16,Fof the car park will enable CCFC to
OL,17,Fplan for the future and look at wider
OL,18,Fregeneration of the area, which is
OL,19,Fexciting."
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
